{
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait, waaaait!"
            ]
        },
        "60_1": {
            "lines": [
                "What?"
            ]
        },
        "60_2": {
            "lines": [
                "I thought you were some tasty, ",
                "foolish humans at long last, but..."
            ]
        },
        "61_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Mystia Lorelei"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What exactly <i$are> you two??"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes. Non-humans."
            ]
        },
        "63_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Non-humans?"
            ]
        },
        "65_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, whether we're human or not ",
                "or whatever, I'm not interested."
            ]
        },
        "65_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Non-humans using this path... ",
                "You don't see that very often."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmm. You seem to be a night sparrow."
            ]
        },
        "67_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you keep only attacking humans..."
            ]
        },
        "68_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There won't be any left around here."
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even so, I doubt she's going to start ",
                "attacking youkai instead..."
            ]
        },
        "70_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, drop it. It's nighttime, most humans",
                "have long since left these paths."
            ]
        },
        "71_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If there were anyone, they'd either be in a real hurry, ",
                "have a few screws loose, or be non-human altogether."
            ]
        },
        "72_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Listen closely. I'm going to repeat this one more time. We",
                "are non-humans, in a real hurry, with a few screws loose."
            ]
        },
        "73_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We don't have time to waste here.",
                "Will you let us pass?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The end of this road isn't a place where",
                "youkai like Yukari often visit, though..."
            ]
        },
        "75_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aw, but I haven't had playmates in so long..."
            ]
        },
        "76_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I know. How about we go to the village",
                "and mess with the humans together?"
            ]
        },
        "77_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ugh, jeeze, how many times do I have to say it!?"
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "?"
            ]
        },
        "79_0": {
            "lines": [
                "??"
            ]
        },
        "80_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not night-blind."
            ]
        },
        "81_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aha, a human."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why don't I <i$make> you night-blind, then!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Really. A night sparrow, of all things."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's much too early for condescension from a flying louse."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Was that really a sparrow just now?",
                "I couldn't make much out in the dark."
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The little birds in the night are mostly night sparrows."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you're not careful around them,",
                "you won't be able to see in the dark anymore."
            ]
        },
        "65_0": {
            "lines": [
                "(...Is that really what sparrows were like?",
                "I couldn't see much.)"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, I can see the Human Village. I didn't",
                "really want to come here with you, though..."
            ]
        }
    }
}